's [[face]], [[tried|try]]. \`[[It]] [[was|be]]... [[maybe]] [[a]] [[little]]...\` \`[[Maybe]] [[what]]?\``,`vn`:`Sau \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng l\u1eb7ng ng\u01b0\u1ee3ng ngh\u1ecbu. Kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed trong ph\u00f2ng c\u0103ng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee9c ngay c\u1ea3 Bao c\u0169ng ng\u1ed3i im. Kh\u00f4ng ai d\u00e1m l\u00ean ti\u1ebfng tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Linh, v\u1ed1n nh\u1ea1y v\u1edbi t\u1eebng thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1ecf tr\u00ean n\u00e9t m\u1eb7t Khoa, th\u1eed m\u1edf l\u1eddi. \`Nghe... c\u00f3 l\u1ebd h\u01a1i...\` \`C\u00f3 l\u1ebd l\u00e0m sao?\``},{`en`:`[[It]] [[was|be]] Bao [[who]] [[was|be]] [[bold]] [[enough]] [[to]] [[finish]] [[the]] [[sentence]]. \`[[You]] [[always]] [[ask]] [[for]] [[honesty]], [[so]] [[here]] [[it]] [[is|be]]. [[You]] [[play]] [[like]] [[a]] [[star]], [[and]] [[you]] [[sing]] [[like]] [[my]] [[bicycle]] [[when]] [[it]] [[needs|need]] [[oil]]. [[I]] don't [[want]] [[to]] [[offend]] [[you]].\``,`vn`:`Ch\u00ednh Bao m\u1edbi l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ee7 b\u1ea1o d\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i n\u1ed1t c\u00e2u \u1ea5y. \`C\u1eadu l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u0111\u00f2i m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u00f3i th\u1eadt, v\u1eady th\u00ec \u0111\u00e2y. C\u1eadu \u0111\u00e1nh \u0111\u00e0n nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i sao, c\u00f2n h\u00e1t th\u00ec nh\u01b0 c\u00e1i xe \u0111\u1ea1p c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh l\u00fac kh\u00f4 d\u1ea7u. M\u00ecnh kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n l\u00e0m c\u1eadu ph\u1eadt l\u00f2ng \u0111\u00e2u.\``},{`en`:`Khoa [[was|be]] [[furious]]. \`[[So]] I'm [[good]] [[enough]] [[to]] [[carry]] [[the]] [[cables|cable]], [[but]] [[not]] [[good]] [[enough]] [[to]] [[be]] [[heard|hear]]?\` [[His]] [[voice]], [[usually]] [[so]] [[controlled|control]], [[had|have]] [[turned|turn]] [[aggressive]], [[and]] [[the]] [[anger]] [[in]] [[it]] [[made|make]] Linh's [[hands|hand]] [[go]] [[cold]]. \`[[And]] [[you]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]], [[turning|turn]] [[to]] [[her]]. \`You're [[going|go]] [[to]] [[sing]] [[at]] [[that]] [