.\``},{`en`:`Khoa [[picked|pick]] [[up]] [[his]] [[bag]] [[and]] [[walked|walk]] [[out]]. [[Thirty]] [[seconds|second]] [[later]], [[the]] [[door]] [[opened|open]] [[again]]: [[he]] [[had|have]] [[forgotten|forget]] [[his]] [[guitar]]. [[Nobody]] [[said|say]] [[a]] [[word]] [[while]] [[he]] [[put]] [[it]] [[in]] [[its]] [[case]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] [[somehow]] [[the]] [[saddest|sad]] [[and]] [[the]] [[funniest|funny]] [[moment]] [[of]] [[the]] [[afternoon]]. [[At]] [[the]] [[door]] [[he]] [[stopped|stop]]. \`[[Sing]] [[at]] [[your]] [[party]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]], [[without]] [[looking|look]] [[at]] Linh. \`[[She]] doesn't [[need]] [[a]] [[band]], [[remember]]?\` [[Then]] [[he]] [[closed]] [[the]] [[door]], [[very]] [[quietly]].`,`vn`:`Khoa x\u00e1ch c\u1eb7p l\u00ean r\u1ed3i b\u01b0\u1edbc ra ngo\u00e0i. Ba m\u01b0\u01a1i gi\u00e2y sau, c\u1eeda l\u1ea1i m\u1edf: c\u1eadu \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00ean c\u00e2y \u0111\u00e0n. Kh\u00f4ng ai n\u00f3i m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi trong l\u00fac c\u1eadu c\u1ea5t \u0111\u00e0n v\u00e0o bao. Ch\u1eb3ng hi\u1ec3u sao \u0111\u00f3 l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc v\u1eeba bu\u1ed3n nh\u1ea5t v\u1eeba bu\u1ed3n c\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u. Ra \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1eeda, c\u1eadu d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i. \`C\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu m\u00e0 h\u00e1t,\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i, kh\u00f4ng nh\u00ecn Linh. \`C\u00f4 \u1ea5y \u0111\u00e2u c\u1ea7n ban nh\u1ea1c, nh\u1edb kh\u00f4ng?\` R\u1ed3i c\u1eadu kh\u00e9p c\u1eeda l\u1ea1i, th\u1eadt kh\u1ebd.`}],`tease`:`Khoa b\u1ecf \u0111i th\u1eadt r\u1ed3i sao? C\u00f4 H\u1ea1nh s\u1ebd n\u00f3i g\u00ec khi bi\u1ebft chuy\u1ec7n?`}]}